<h1>Quarry View Recorder</h1>
<p><strong>Vintage Story: 1.22.x.</strong></p>
<p>the fox kept the camera and changed the label. the recorder starts off and keeps its existing controls.</p>
<p>Ctrl+Shift+F10 toggles the singleplayer four-view timelapse recorder. It starts off, repeats every ten real minutes, restores the camera/input state after each round, and can pause after the watched quarry or finite mine finishes. Starting recording disables temporal storms for that world.</p>
<p>Minimum game version: 1.22.0. Load/save/reload smoke passed on 1.22.7. Feature-specific gameplay remains outside that smoke.</p>
<p><em>mod was made with AI assistance. Pls no hate.</em></p>
